# C family (.c and .h) — project convention: .h/.c are C (see .github/skills/_shared/code-conventions.md).
# No `Language: C` key: only LLVM 23+ accepts it, while MegaLinter's bundled clang-format may be older.
# The native gate uses clang-format 23.1.0; MegaLinter v10.2.0 may bundle a different release.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 4
TabWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
ColumnLimit: 120
MaxEmptyLinesToKeep: 3

# Keep the 2-blank-line module split rule intact (MaxEmptyLinesToKeep >= 2)
# Close docstring re-format
ReflowComments: false
SortIncludes: false
BreakBeforeBraces: Attach
PointerAlignment: Right
